0..78 Comment "// `gc` collects an empty restriction and `scope` extrudes one past a parallel"
79..155 Comment "// component. They overlap at `par(nu(nil()), q)`, which completion joins by"
156..232 Comment "// the rule `nu(par(nil, q)) ==> par(nil, q)`; that rule and `scope` overlap"
233..313 Comment "// in turn, joined by the same rule with `nil` wrapped in `par(□, q\')`, and so"
314..388 Comment "// on, one wrapping deeper every round, where no rule rewrites a wrapping."
389..466 Comment "// Completion never ends, and the block is refused by name at the second rule"
467..535 Comment "// it derives rather than once its budget of derived rules runs out."
536..538 Comment "//"
539..554 Comment "// - see: #1604"
555..588 Comment "// - see: #1917 — `Restriction`"
590..660 Comment "/// A restriction that extrudes its scope and is collected once empty."
